Derived from Create (The Create Team / Creators of Create):

  block/soulstained_axis.png              from create:block/axis
  block/soulstained_axis_top.png          from create:block/axis_top
  block/soulstained_cogwheel_axis.png     from create:block/cogwheel_axis
  block/obsidiansteel_cogwheel.png        from create:block/cogwheel
  block/rose_gold_cogwheel.png            from create:block/cogwheel

  Each is a luminance remap: Create's shading is preserved and only the palette
  is replaced. Models additionally reference Create's own models and textures by
  path at runtime (parent "create:block/cogwheel", and the controller's
  blockstate layering over "create:block/rotation_speed_controller/block").

Palettes taken from:

  Malum (soul stained steel)               - soulstained_*
  Forbidden & Arcanus (obsidiansteel)      - obsidiansteel_cogwheel
  Slag 'n Embers (rose gold)               - rose_gold_cogwheel


